$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add assets:bank:mybank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add assets:bank:leumi --currency ILS --opening 1000 --date 2026-09-30
Added assets:bank:leumi (ILS).

$ moolah profile list
Name         Source    Description
generic-csv  built-in  CSV with columns Date, Description, Amount (YYYY-MM-DD dates, negative = money out)

$ moolah import $TMP/oct.csv
error: which account is this file for? Add --account, for example --account card:max (moolah remembers it for next time)
[exit 1]

$ moolah import test $TMP/oct.csv --account leumi
Profile generic-csv, account assets:bank:leumi. Nothing was saved (test only).

Line  Date        Payee                       Amount  Category       Status
   2  2026-10-01  SHUFERSAL DEAL 1234    -200.00 ILS  uncategorized  new
   3  2026-10-02  Coffee                  -12.00 ILS  uncategorized  new
   4  2026-10-02  Coffee                  -12.00 ILS  uncategorized  new
   5  2026-10-05  Salary               18,500.00 ILS  uncategorized  new

$ moolah import $TMP/oct.csv --account leumi
Imported $TMP/oct.csv into assets:bank:leumi with profile generic-csv: 4 new.
Import ID 1 (undo with: moolah import undo 1).
4 rows have no category yet. Give them one with: moolah review

$ moolah rule add shufersal food:groceries
Added rule 1. It categorized 1 transaction that had no category.

$ moolah rule add ^salary$ salary
Added rule 2. It categorized 1 transaction that had no category.

$ moolah import $TMP/oct-nov.csv
Imported $TMP/oct-nov.csv into assets:bank:leumi with profile generic-csv: 1 new, 1 already imported.
Import ID 2 (undo with: moolah import undo 2).

$ moolah review
2 transactions have no category. Set one with: moolah review set <id> <category>

ID  Date        Payee   Account                Amount
 3  2026-10-02  Coffee  assets:bank:leumi  -12.00 ILS
 4  2026-10-02  Coffee  assets:bank:leumi  -12.00 ILS

$ moolah review set 4 restaurants
Transaction 4 → food:restaurants.

$ moolah review set 5 restaurnts
error: transaction 5 is not uncategorized
[exit 1]

$ moolah rule list
ID  Pattern    Category        Amount  Tags
 1  shufersal  food:groceries
 2  ^salary$   income:salary

$ moolah import list
ID  When              File         Account            Profile      Rows  Created
 2  2026-11-04 12:00  oct-nov.csv  assets:bank:leumi  generic-csv     1        1
 1  2026-11-04 12:00  oct.csv      assets:bank:leumi  generic-csv     4        4

